#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:228
msgid ""
"With \"Start Minimized\" and \"Fullscreen\" this is the classic cast-target "
"setup: the app waits out of the way, plays fullscreen when something casts "
"to it, and goes back to waiting when the video ends or you press Q."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:242
msgid ""
"Off means command-line mode: no window, no system tray and no settings "
"screen, so the only way back is editing conf.json by hand. It is not how you "
"get MPV's own on-screen controls — \"Player Controls Style\" under Interface "
"does that."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:249
msgid ""
"Show only what is cast to this machine — the library, including this "
"settings screen, can't be reached from here. Without a system tray icon the "
"only way back is editing conf.json. For the classic cast-target setup you "
"want the Interface settings instead; this is for a shared TV nobody should "
"be able to browse from."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:255
msgid ""
"Requires restart to change. MPV keybinds are used by default. Press ENTER to "
"drive the player controls by keyboard."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:257
msgid ""
"Pixels one wheel notch scrolls. The scrollbar glides while the content snaps "
"to the nearest row, so a trackpad or trackball no longer overshoots. Raise "
"it to scroll faster, lower it for finer control."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:262
msgid ""
"Make each wheel notch jump exactly one row (or one home-screen section) "
"instead of gliding. Turn this on if you prefer the older stepped scrolling."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:270
msgid "Discord Rich Presence. Takes effect after a restart."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:272
msgid ""
"Leave this to Default unless setting up passthrough. Note some audio servers "
"like Pipewire don't like passthrough and will need to be disabled for a card "
"before it'll let *any* audio through in passthrough mode. In my tests I got "
"silence otherwise, but results may vary."
msgstr ""
"Dejar en predeterminado salvo que estés configurando passthrough. Ten en "
"cuenta que algunos servidores de audio, como Pipewire, no se llevan bien con "
"passthrough y será necesario desactivar la tarjeta para que permita "
"*cualquier* audio en modo passthrough. En mis pruebas obtuve silencio; pero "
"los resultados pueden variar."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:278
msgid ""
"Stop anything else using the device while playing. Needed for passthrough on "
"some systems, and it means other applications will be silent."
msgstr ""
"Para todas las demás aplicaciones que estén utilizando el dispositivo "
"durante la reproducción. Es necesario para passthrough en algunos sistemas, "
"y significa que las demás aplicaciones quedarán en silencio."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:281
msgid ""
"Page the library and music tile grids instead of scrolling: each page is one "
"screenful with First / Previous / Next / Last controls and a page number you "
"can type into. Easier than precise scrolling on a trackpad."
msgstr ""
"Pagina la biblioteca y las cuadrículas de música en lugar de utilizar el "
"desplazamiento vertical: cada página ocupa una pantalla completa y ofrece "
"controles de Primero / Anterior / Siguiente / Último, además de un número de "
"página editable. Más fácil que hacer desplazamientos precisos con el "
"trackpad."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:285
msgid ""
"Palette, glow, cover style and default cover size. Colours change "
"immediately; cover and heading sizes take effect after a restart."
msgstr ""
"Paleta, brillo, estilo de portada y tamaño de portada predeterminado. Los "
"colores cambian de inmediato; los tamaños de portada y encabezados se "
"aplican tras reiniciar."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:288
msgid "Overrides the theme's cover size. Takes effect after a restart."
msgstr "Sobrescribe el tamaño de portada del tema. Se aplica tras reiniciar."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:290
msgid ""
"Takes effect after a restart. \"Follow display\" uses the scale your desktop "
"reports, which is 100% on X11."
msgstr ""
"Se aplica tras reiniciar. \"Seguir la pantalla\" usa la escala que indica tu "
"escritorio, que en X11 es del 100%."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:292
msgid ""
"\"Default\" changes nothing and lets MPV (and your own mpv.conf) decide. "
"Pick a mode only if you are sending audio to a receiver."
msgstr ""
"\"Por defecto\" no cambia nada y deja que MPV (y tu propio mpv.conf) "
"decidan. Elige un modo solo si estás enviando el audio a un receptor."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:295
msgid ""
"Audio your receiver can't be sent directly is encoded to AC3, which is the "
"only way surround fits down an optical cable. Turn this off if the encoder "
"causes audio delay — those tracks become stereo instead."
msgstr ""
"El audio que tu receptor no puede recibir directamente se codifica en AC3, "
"que es la única forma de enviar sonido envolvente por un cable óptico. "
"Desactiva esta opción si el codificador provoca retraso de audio: esas "
"pistas pasarán a ser estéreo."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:300
msgid ""
"\"hq\" offers heavier profiles. Pick it if you have a fast graphics card."
msgstr ""
"\"hq\" ofrece perfiles más exigentes. Elígelo si tienes una tarjeta gráfica "
"rápida."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:302
msgid ""
"Leave on Automatic unless video breaks when a profile is loaded. This only "
"applies while a profile is active, and OpenGL can cost you HDR output."
msgstr ""
"Déjalo en automático salvo que el vídeo falle al cargar un perfil. Esto solo "
"se aplica mientras un perfil está activo, y OpenGL puede hacer que pierdas "
"la salida HDR."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:306
msgid ""
"Evens out loud effects and quiet dialogue. This turns passthrough off while "
"it is enabled, because the volume has to be adjusted before your receiver "
"gets the audio."
msgstr ""
"Iguala los efectos fuertes y los diálogos suaves. Esto desactiva passthrough "
"mientras está habilitado, porque el volumen debe ajustarse antes de que el "
"receptor reciba el audio."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py:388
